# Trait Doctoring replaces the color word red with blue in Sunforger's text until end of turn (CR 612.1), so its ability
# searches for "a blue or white instant card with mana value 4 or less": Lightning Bolt, red, is refused and Ancestral
# Recall, blue, is found and cast for free. The {R}{W} in its cost is mana symbols, not words, and is paid as printed.

